| G1: Deliver food to inpatient room | Achieve the delivery of food from the kitchen to the inpatient room. | `;` | Achieve | Food is placed on the table **or** patient has retrieved the meal and dishes are cleared. | AND | All mission phases (pick‑up, transport, delivery, dish‑cleanup, door‑opening, logging, alerting) must succeed in order. |
