| G1.7.1: Open door alone | Robot opens door by itself. | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot can open door. |
| G1.7.2: Open door with human | Robot cooperates with human to open door. | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Human assists if robot cannot. |
| G1.8: Track meal retrieval | Log when and where each meal was retrieved. | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must record retrieval data. |
| G1.9: Alert wrong meal | Notify if wrong meal is retrieved. | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must detect and alert. |

